      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a financial-document segmentation assistant.\n\nDivide the following financial report text into meaningful semantic chunks based on topic, headings, and financial context.\n\nRules:\n1. Preserve the original wording, financial figures, dates, and terminology.\n2. Do not summarize, rewrite, calculate, or invent information.\n3. Keep related financial tables, headings, and values together wherever possible.\n4. Target approximately 500–1,000 words per chunk, but prioritize meaningful topic boundaries.\n5. Return only valid JSON with a \"chunks\" array.\n6. Each chunk must contain \"chunk_id\", \"topic\", and \"text\".\n\nSOURCE TEXT:\n\n{{ $json.sample_text }}",
